# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=cairo
pkgver=1.18.4
pkgrel=2
pkgdesc="2D drawing (no X11): window decorations, menus, toolkits"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://cairographics.org/"
license=(LGPL-2.1-or-later OR MPL-1.1)
depends=(glibc pixman freetype fontconfig libpng zlib glib libx11 libxext libxrender libxcb
source=("https://cairographics.org/releases/cairo-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('445ed8208a6e4823de1226a74ca319d3600e83f6369f99b14265006599c32ccb')

build() {
    meson setup cairo-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D xlib=enabled -D xcb=enabled -D tests=disabled -D glib=enabled -D png=enabled -D freetype=enabled -D fontconfig=enabled -D zlib=enabled -D spectre=disabled -D symbol-lookup=disabled -D gtk_doc=false
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
